@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Obtener todos los incidentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents

### Filtrar por categoría
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?category=bache

### Filtrar por estado
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?status=pendiente

### Buscar por texto
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?search=bache

### Obtener GeoJSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/geojson

### Obtener incidente por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/INC-001

### Crear un nuevo incidente
POST {{baseUrl}}/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Nuevo bache en calle principal",
    "category": "bache",
    "description": "Bache peligroso en la esquina",
    "status": "pendiente",
    "latitude": 21.125,
    "longitude": -101.685
}

### Actualizar un incidente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incidents/INC-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Bache reparado frente a la universidad",
    "status": "atendido"
}

### Eliminar un incidente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/incidents/INC-003
